# Build-time-generated responsive image variants. The base
# `public/blog/<slug>.webp` source files ARE committed; the per-size /
# per-format variants are produced by scripts/optimize-images.mjs during
# `prebuild` on Vercel. Keeps the repo ~125 MB lighter and means a single
# regenerate happens per deploy. (technical-SEO audit Fix 5.)
public/blog/*-w320.webp
public/blog/*-w320.avif
public/blog/*-w768.webp
public/blog/*-w768.avif
public/blog/*-w1200.webp
public/blog/*-w1200.avif

